### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Acute client config ping
GET http://localhost:3000/acute-test/ping

### Dry run raw Acute request to /organisations
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request?dryRun=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/organisations",
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### Raw Acute request to /organisations
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/organisations",
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### Dry run configured entity fetch for organisation
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/entity/organisation/fetch?dryRun=true

### Configured entity fetch for organisation
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/entity/organisation/fetch

### Trigger full sync for organisation
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/sync/organisation

